  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BDC Ukraina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BDC Ukraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">M&#xe4;lardalen University, in cooperation with Id&#xe9;lab/Munktell Science Park and a third, Lithuanian part, will build up capacity at two universities in Ukraine to establish Business Development Centers. The dev. obj. is to contribute to an adaptation of the way innovation and enterpreneurship are viewed in Ukraine to what is currently applied in Europe, thereby increasing entrepreneurial activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe4;lardalens H&#xf6;gskola skall, i samverkan med Id&#xe9;lab/Munktell Science Park och en tredje, litauisk part, bygga upp kapacitet hos tv&#xe5; ukrainska universitet att etablera Business Development Centers. Syftet &#xe4;r att bidra till en f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring mot en mera Europeisk syn p&#xe5; innovation och f&#xf6;retagande och d&#xe4;rmed till en &#xf6;kad f&#xf6;retagsamhet i landet.</narrative>
  </description>
